## Third-party and proprietary components

This repository is a Vector Software Integration Package (SIP) delivery
(serial CBD1500635, GM SLP6 / Renesas RH850). Many files carry their own
copyright and license headers which take precedence over the MIT license
above for those files. In particular:

- Files with `Copyright (c) ... Vector Informatik GmbH` headers remain
  proprietary to Vector Informatik GmbH / Vector CANtech, Inc. and are
  licensed only under the Vector license conditions referenced in those
  headers and in the delivery addendum
  (`Doc/DeliveryInformation/2493.2_ADD_Nexteer_FBL_GM_SLP6_Renesas RH850-CBD1500635.D03.pdf`).
- `BSW/Flash/FlashLib/*` (Renesas FCL) remains under the Renesas disclaimer
  in `r_fcl.h` (use only with Renesas products, provided "AS IS").
- `BSW/SecMod/act*.c|h` implement the cryptovision `actCLibrary` and carry
  cryptovision GmbH copyright notices.
- `MakeSupport/cmd/*` GNU/Cygwin utilities remain under GPL/LGPL as shipped
  (`GPL_ENGLISH.txt`, `GPL_GERMAN.txt`, `GNU_LGPL_v3.0.html`, `CYGWIN_LICENSE.txt`).
- `Misc/HexView/*` remains under the Vector HexView license (`license.liz`)
  and disclaimer (`disclaimer.txt`).
- Demo RSA keys in `Misc/DemoKey_2048/rsakeys_2048.txt` are demo keys only
  and must not be used in production.

The MIT license above applies to the documentation, build glue, and
integration artefacts created in this repository (notably `README.md`,
`docs/`, `.github/`), and to any file that does not carry a conflicting
copyright/license header. When in doubt, the header inside the file wins.
